@startuml Register Warehouse User

title 倉庫管理者建立一般員工帳號（POST /api/v1/auth/warehouseAdmin/register/warehouseUser，WarehouseAdminOnly）

actor "倉庫管理者\n(WarehouseAdmin)" as Caller

box "Organization.Api" #LightBlue
    participant "RegisterWarehouseUserEndpoint" as Endpoint
end box

box "Organization.Domain" #Lavender
    participant "User" as UserAgg
end box

box "Organization.Infrastructure" #WhiteSmoke
    participant "IUserRepository" as UserRepo
    participant "IPasswordHasher" as Hasher
    participant "ITokenGenerator" as TokenGen
    participant "IRefreshTokenRepository" as RefreshRepo
end box

database "organization_db" as DB

Caller -> Endpoint : POST { name, username, password }\n(Authorization: Bearer <呼叫者自己的 JWT>)
Endpoint -> Endpoint : RequireAuthorization("WarehouseAdminOnly")
Endpoint -> Endpoint : warehouseId = 從呼叫者 JWT claim 取得\n（不接受 request body 傳入）
Endpoint -> UserRepo : GetByUsername(username, ct)

alt 帳號已存在
    UserRepo --> Endpoint : Result.Success
    Endpoint --> Caller : 400 BadRequest "Username already exists"
else 帳號不存在
    Endpoint -> UserAgg : User.Register(warehouseId, name, username,\nhasher.Hash(password), Role.WarehouseUser)
    UserAgg --> Endpoint : new User
    Endpoint -> Endpoint : TokenClaims.FromUserAsync(newUser) → 立刻簽發\n該新帳號自己的 accessToken / refreshToken
    Endpoint -> TokenGen : GenerateToken / GenerateRefreshToken
    Endpoint -> UserRepo : AddAsync(newUser, ct)
    UserRepo -> DB : insert into users
    Endpoint -> RefreshRepo : AddAsync(refreshToken, ct)
    RefreshRepo -> DB : insert into refresh_tokens
    Endpoint --> Caller : 200 OK { userId, accessToken, refreshToken, refreshTokenExpiredAt }
end

note over Endpoint
  角色固定寫死為 Role.WarehouseUser，這支 API 不能拿來
  建立 WarehouseAdmin 或 Admin。
end note

note over Endpoint, UserRepo
  另有 admin/register/user（AdminOnly）結構完全相同，
  差別是 WarehouseId／Role 由總管理者在 request body 指定，
  可以建立任何角色、指派到任意倉庫，這裡不重複畫。
end note

@enduml